        "decision": "All 29 pairs include note-filter-help inside a closed details element. Follow-up visibility tests at five widths report checkVisibility=false; selected screenshots show no painted help/card collision. Classified as closed-disclosure geometry noise, not a reason to alter the approved layout."
      },
      "occlusion": {
        "count": 4,
        "decision": "Four eyebrow-box/pause hit-area intersections. The eyebrow spans its row while glyphs align to the right and the icon is at the left. Inspected hero screenshots show no glyph overlap. Box sampling is not text-pixel sampling."
      },
      "fixed-sticky-overlay-collision": {
        "count": 457,
        "decision": "457 geometric intersections with persistent approved chrome during natural/pinned scrolling. Scrolling content behind sticky header/island is expected, but this category is not blanket-dismissed as a pass. Representative screenshots and end-of-page/interactive controls were checked. The separately reproduced dropdown obstruction was a real interaction defect and was fixed. Individual raw overlap snapshots were not all visually adjudicated."
      },
      "tap-target": {
        "count": 50,
        "decision": "50 box-size hints. Phone/coarse-pointer CSS already expands logo, quiet-link and discovery links using pseudo-elements; desktop hints include narrow text links. Scanner measures element rectangles, not pseudo hit areas. Existing visual sizes preserved; not a blanket 44px certification."
      }
    }
